  "editorial_title": "MARKET COMMENTARY:",
  "nutshell": [
    "- There is a strong positive correlation between spot market",
    "- earnings and 15yo Supramax prices. (Page 1)",
    "- Asset prices are higher at similar spot rates compared to",
    "- previous years,indicating fundamental market shifts.(Page 1)",
    "- Structural factors like newbuilding costs, supply discipline,",
    "- and regulations underpin elevated asset values at every",
